  "type": null,
  "body": "@AlphaTechini I could not apply option 1. Step F1 (read the marker): the issue description I received ends at \"Reply with a mention of Downstream followed by `fix option N` in this issue to apply option N.\" It has no hidden \"downstream:v1 \" marker line, so I can't run fixcheck or find the merge request and journey to re-measure. I made no changes. If the marker was removed by an edit, restore it or re-run Downstream on !11 to get a fresh issue, then reply \"fix it\" again.",
